{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 190,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am going to scream as loud as I can and\nI am going to keep screaming as loud as I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3550,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can while I spin around. I will keep going\nuntil my breath runs out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7360,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8160,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You ready? \u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9300,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ok [Screams]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18340,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That was outstanding. Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19580,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21340,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The quietest place on earth is apparently\nan anechoic chamber in Minneapolis. Now I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25890,
    "dDurationMs": 5430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "am here at BYU at their anechoic chamber.\nAnechoic is Latin and basically means no echo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31320,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the way they achieve no echo is through\nall of these foam wedges which are put on the wall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36010,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even the floor. You can see\nthat I am actually on a spring floor and down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41050,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "below me there are all of these wedges."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43780,
    "dDurationMs": 3599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you may want to use headphones while you\nare listening to this video, because that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47379,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is going to be quite important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48999,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Low frequency sound will come in and, by\nthe shape of it, bounce and just keep bouncing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54489,
    "dDurationMs": 5361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretty much forever until it just gets lost\nin the wall. And then high frequencies are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59850,
    "dDurationMs": 2989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more so going to get absorbed into the foam\nitself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62839,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You can hear how the room deadens echoes\nby clapping constantly while closing the doors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67560,
    "dDurationMs": 20200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Clapping]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87760,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It totally changes the quality of the sound.\n\u003e\u003e Definitely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90850,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e There are reports that it is impossible\nto stay in one of these rooms and remain sane"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94240,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a significant period of time. The record\nis apparently 45 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97810,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I felt a little claustrophobic. And yet, it\nfelt like there is a lot of pressure on my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102650,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104100,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But why would that be? I mean, the air\nis no different in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107750,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What I figured is just because when you\nlisten in a normal room there is a lot of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111340,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reverb. To your ear that means there is a\nlot of space, but there is none of that in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115800,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here, so it feels claustrophobic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117620,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It feels like you are in a tiny room, like\nyou could be in a coffin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120830,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003eYeah, maybe, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122980,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I think it is really an anxiety response.\nSo you are used to having these sounds around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127280,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you and then you don’t anymore and so you\nstart to panic, because you don’t have something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131230,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are used to, and I think that anxiety can\nincrease, cause some stress, and maybe that's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136090,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why people go crazy or hallucinate with\nsound. It is just because they are trying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140350,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make up for what they are used to that\nisn’t there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142350,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e When I bring people in I warn them: Hey,\nif you get a little dizzy, please let me know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146230,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I can get you out of the room before you\nmake a mess in our expensive facilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154220,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e First you will hear any rustle of your\nclothing. So you move an inch and you will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157569,
    "dDurationMs": 4351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hear it. Then you will hear any fluids that\nare in your mouth or your throat. You'll"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161920,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hear them all moving around every time you\nmove your mouth. And the longer you stay there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166520,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more you will hear. So you will start\nto hear the blood flow through your brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169650,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Have you heard it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170630,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah. It sounds kind of like a ringing\nor a pulsing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173930,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Can you kind of make the sound for us so\nthat we know what to listen in for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176770,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Of the blood flow? \u003e\u003e Yeah, like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178400,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It just sounds like a pulsing, like, shh,\nshh, shh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181160,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people say they can hear their heart\nbeat coming from their chest as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184950,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Have you heard that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185750,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187459,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e A violinist placed in one of these rooms\nwas apparently banging on the door within a matter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190700,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of seconds trying to get out. Now\nthat people say it's impossible to stand up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 6900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you become so disoriented, dizzy, nauseous. And some people even hear oral hallucinations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201910,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But to me it doesn’t sound right. You know,\nI believe that I should be able to sit in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205330,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a room with no sound with the lights off for\nas long as I like. And so I am going to put"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209970,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "myself to the test by staying in this room\nfor as long as I can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216200,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Have fun in silence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217640,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224230,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now it is just me in the anechoic chamber.\nAnd this is probably the quietest place I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229650,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have ever been. And in a second I will tell the\nguys, shut the lights off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236640,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok, I think..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238540,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. I am ready."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242160,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the lights are off. I'm going \nto turn off the camera so I don’t"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245150,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have this light and then there is only the\naudio recorder that I will keep with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269600,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure how long I have been in here,\nbut I still feel quite comfortable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275800,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's nice and quiet. I mean, that is an understatement.\nBut it's relaxing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286700,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I hear anything, I feel like I hear a low pitched hum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318360,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I have to guess as to how long I have been\nin here I would say about eight minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328120,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like I am more aware of my heart. I\ncan feel each pulse, and I can almost feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335040,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it radiating up my chest towards my head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339480,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344820,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in my ears there's a hiss. \nI think that is just..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350160,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from hearing loss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353460,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This just reminds me of that Mission Impossible\nmovie where Tom Cruise sneaks into that building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359220,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he has to keep his decibel level low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363920,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Quiet burp]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366800,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was a burp. I don’t know if you could\nhear that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370260,
    "dDurationMs": 8659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can say the really small sounds seem amplified.\nIt is like your brain has recalibrated, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378919,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the quiet things seem much louder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385440,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like I can feel more things like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with every beat of my heart it feels like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394580,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my body shakes a little bit..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398960,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a device that has\na little motor inside of it. How it gets shook around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403970,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a thumb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407180,
    "dDurationMs": 7079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok, Cameron, looks to me like we are good\nfor time. If it looks the same to you like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414259,
    "dDurationMs": 8461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we are around 46 minutes or over, I am happy\nto hop out. So, yeah, when you are ready you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422720,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could flip the lights back on if you like.\nAre you there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432020,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435200,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I have been in here for nearly\nan hour according to my time checks. And I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440440,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn’t fall asleep, I just, you know,\nI have had a good time. It is a nice quiet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445350,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "space. I kind of feel like this would be a\ngood material to pad your bedroom in. Not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449020,
    "dDurationMs": 5590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a problem. Anechoic chamber, 45 minutes, an\nhour. Easy. I could stay in here for five"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454610,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hours. I think I could get a lot of work done\nin here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461130,
    "dDurationMs": 7340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now I just have to get out. And I am going\nto see if I can exit this room without them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468470,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "turning the lights on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480280,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even the doors are nice and quiet. There we are.\nBack to the outside world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506620,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, how are you doing?\n\u003e\u003e You alive? \u003e\u003e I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509980,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't really understand how anyone could go crazy in there. I mean, quiet is kind of nice. But then again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515940,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are people who find all sorts of situations\nreally uncomfortable like just being in pitch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519860,
    "dDurationMs": 5310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "black room or being in a small confined space.\nSo maybe those types of people would find"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525170,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this kind of unnerving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526920,
    "dDurationMs": 4870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I definitely noticed that there were a lot\nof noises. Like it wasn’t just pure silence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531790,
    "dDurationMs": 5870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I actually have to work hard to make\nthings feel silent. Otherwise, you know, there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537660,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was the sound of like me just rubbing my beard\nor just like the rustle of your clothes or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543880,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every time you swallow or you breathe. Perhaps\nthe weirdest thing I noticed was like my sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549060,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of my heart. I just felt like it was pumping\nreally hard, and I could feel almost like the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556260,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "blood pushing up through me. It wasn’t like\nI was hearing it. It was just like I was feeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560440,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. And I was feeling it as though, in a way,\nmy heart"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563540,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was shaking my body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566200,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was something weird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568840,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But besides that, nothing crazy, no weird hallucinations\nor anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575170,
    "dDurationMs": 6930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think the myth that you can’t stay\nin here for longer than 45 minutes is busted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582100,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though this is not Myth Busters. I still\nthink it is not true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590130,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if you really hate silence, you should\nalways carry an audio book around with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594310,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can recommend a good one: The Fault\nin our Stars by my friend John Green. It is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598370,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an excellent book and it has been basically\nthe talk of the best sellers ever since it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602040,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was released. And soon there is a movie coming\nout and so you probably want to get through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605660,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the book before you go and see the movie.\nNow you can download this book for free by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609570,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to Audible.com/Veritasium. Or you could\npick any other book of your choosing for a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614220,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one month free trial. Audible is an amazing\nsite with over 150,000 titles in all areas"
